# G.I. Joe 4x, Act 1: the stock X-COM alien missions picked from the region tables are switched off (John 17 Nov 09:21,
# "Agreed" to BUILD's list): research, harvest, abduction and infiltration. All four come from three stock mission
# scripts - gameStart (one research flight on day 1), recon (from month 1) and invasion (from month 6) - which pick
# from each region's missionWeights; the alien base was already out (zz_gijoe_act1_no_stock_bases.rul).
# Infiltration was the one doing harm: it took countries and founded X-COM bases, ramping to 20 flights a month.
# Abduction is off until STORY writes Cobra kidnappings. Stays on: Cobra's own scripts (fronts, sites, cartel, airstrip,
# the Act 1 network in the engine), the Drome's terror attacks (zz_gijoe_terror_source.rul, the Drome's genMission),
# supply flights to Cobra sites, and the retaliation scripts (month 10+ and after shoot-downs).
# A month past any campaign is how zz_gijoe_terror_source.rul already parks recurringTerror. New campaigns only.
missionScripts:
  - type: gameStart
    firstMonth: 9999
  - type: recon
    firstMonth: 9999
  - type: invasion
    firstMonth: 9999
